      {
        "id": 2136247855,
        "content": "12.5 seconds is insane to load the page. There seems to be issues around Gnosis Chain RPC calls occurring constantly. \r\nEach request to the Gnosis Chain RPC takes about 400ms in my testing. We should definitely be able to get this page to load under one second with batching requests and handling this more intelligently. We should aim to handle this in half a second with a single Gnosis Chain round trip, but under one second will be acceptable. \r\n<img width=\"2672\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/ubiquity/pay.ubq.fi/assets/4975670/6cbc1473-02e7-41f1-90ad-20f74d3d53e5\">\r\n[pay.ubq.fi.har.zip](https://github.com/ubiquity/pay.ubq.fi/files/14295950/pay.ubq.fi.har.zip)",
        "url": "https://github.com/ubiquity/pay.ubq.fi/issues/158",
        "commentType": "ISSUE_SPECIFICATION",
