        "id": 1886442394,
        "content": "Looks like a 2-3x improvement which is nice. \nHow many RPC round trips did you save on exactly? I can't test now from mobile. \nIt's appreciated that you did all the other optimizations but I think for the sake of review it would be better if you added the out of scope changes in a separate pull request and instead only focus on RPC related matters in this one as per the specification. \nMy HAR file is proof that the RPC delay is primarily the issue, not minifying CSS etc (running from local host makes this a non factor)",
