        "id": 1953811476,
        "content": "You're welcome to file a new issue to try that out. \r\nHowever I think all of those are extremely minor compared to the RPC issue, to the point where I would put that as lowest priority. We should pick the fastest RPC, and then display a modal/popup to prompt the user to change to the fastest endpoint. This can involve manually removing the existing RPC and then adding our recommended one. \r\nWe can display the modal if the round trip time is greater than 5 seconds, for example.",
